  <section class="benefit-benchmark" id="questions" aria-labelledby="method-questions"><h2 id="method-questions">Questions about payout methods</h2>
    <h3>Which sweepstakes casino payment method is fastest?</h3><p>Social Casino Index does not name a fastest method yet. The published windows above cover different stages, such as processing, approval or delivery after approval, and funded tests are still needed for a measured comparison.</p>
    <h3>Are gift-card redemptions faster than bank transfers?</h3><p>Some operators publish shorter gift-card windows than bank-transfer windows, but the stages are not always the same. Gift-card minimums can also be lower than cash minimums.</p>
